    <briefdescription>
<para>Uncached block allocator where allocations and deallocations are directly performed as CUDA API calls (cudaMallocAsync, ...) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is actually a wrapper on top of the uncached allocator automatically created within each context backend, so deinit is a no-op. The intent of this wrapper is to make it possible to create an allocator policy using this internal allocator. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
